This directory contains a vendored copy of the "estimator" package from the
Lattice Estimator project:

    https://github.com/malb/lattice-estimator

Upstream commit is recorded in UPSTREAM_COMMIT. Only the estimator/ package is
copied here; refresh it with scripts/update-estimator.sh.

The Lattice Estimator is released under the LGPLv3+ license (see the upstream
repository). It is used here only to estimate LWE security for parameter
selection. All credit for the estimator goes to its authors (Martin Albrecht
and contributors).

If you use it in published work, cite it as the upstream README requests.
